{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 1.3.2 Governmental Organizational Act 1.3.2.010 Short Title 1.3.2.020 Definitions 1.3.2.030 Purpose 1.3.2.040 Findings 1.3.2.050 Organization 1.3.2.060 Sovereign Immunity 1.3.2.070 Severability", "num": "1.3.2", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2", "title": "Part 1.3.2 Governmental Organizational Act", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.010 Short Title This enactment shall be known as the Governmental Organizational Act (\"Organization Act\"). ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.010", "title": "1.3.2.010 Short Title", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.020 Definitions (a) \"Agreement\" means the Pueblo de San Ildefonso governing Agreement. (b) \"Council\" means the Pueblo de San Ildefonso Council. (c) \"Department\" means a division established under the Executive Branch of the Pueblo de San Ildefonso. (d) \"Pueblo\" means the Pueblo de San Ildefonso. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.020", "title": "1.3.2.020 Definitions", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.030 Purpose The purpose of the Act is to establish procedures regarding governmental organization of the Pueblo. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.030", "title": "1.3.2.030 Purpose", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.040 Findings The Council hereby finds that, establishing a clear governmental organization will promote efficiency and the cost-effective delivery of services to Members. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.040", "title": "1.3.2.040 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.050", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.050 Organization Governmental Organization \u2013 The Council hereby adopts the attached organizational chart ( See, Exhibit A). The Governor may not reorganize the attached organizational chart without prior Council approval. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.050", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.050", "title": "1.3.2.050 Organization", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.050"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.060", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.060 Sovereign Immunity Nothing in this Act waives the sovereign immunity of the Pueblo or any of its representatives, officers, or employees. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.060", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.060", "title": "1.3.2.060 Sovereign Immunity", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.060"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.070", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.2.070 Severability If a court of competent jurisdiction finds any provision of this Act to be invalid or illegal under applicable tribal and/or federal law, such provision shall be severed from this Act and the remainder of this Act shall remain in full force and effect. ( August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.2.070", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.2|1.3.2.070", "title": "1.3.2.070 Severability", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.2.070"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 1.3.3 Governmental Organizational Act of 2016 1.3.3.010 Findings 1.3.3.020 Short Title 1.3.3.030 Purpose 1.3.3.040 Findings 1.3.3.050 Governmental Organization Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R16-015, dated July 21, 2016.", "num": "1.3.3", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3", "title": "Part 1.3.3 Governmental Organizational Act of 2016", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.3.010 Findings (a) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso (\"Pueblo') is a sovereign and self-governing Tribe, recognized as such by the United States of America; (b) The voters of the Pueblo approved a Governing Agreement (\"Agreement\") for the Pueblo on November 19, 2011, and the Bureau of Indian Affairs approved the Agreement on December 21, 2011, pursuant to Federal law; (c) The Council is authorized to make laws for the Pueblo de San Ildefonso pursuant to Section 5 of the Agreement; (d) The Council finds the need to reaffirm and enact an organizational chart for the Pueblo; (e) The Council hereby enacts the attached law entitled, \"GOVERNMENTAL ORGANIZATIONAL ACT OF 2016.\" (f) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Council hereby approves and adopts this resolution in accordance with the requirements of the Agreement, according to published Council procedures, and authorizes and directs the Governor, or his designee, to take such actions as deemed necessary to carry out the intent of this resolution. ( July 21, 2016, SI-R16-015 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.3.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3|1.3.3.010", "title": "1.3.3.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.3.020 Short Title This enactment shall be known as the \"GOVERNMENTAL ORGANIZATIONAL ACT OF 2016\" (\"Act\"). ( July 21, 2016, SI-R16-015 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.3.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3|1.3.3.020", "title": "1.3.3.020 Short Title", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.3.030 Purpose The purpose of this Act is to adopt a single organizational chart for the government of the Pueblo, and to repeal all prior organizational charts for the government of the Pueblo. ( July 21, 2016, SI-R16-015 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.3.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3|1.3.3.030", "title": "1.3.3.030 Purpose", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.3.040 Findings The Council hereby finds and declares that: (a) Establishing a clear governmental organization, including clear lines of authority, will promote efficiency and the cost-effective delivery of services to Members. (b) In 2012, soon after the adoption of the Government Agreement by the voters of the Pueblo, the Council passed Resolution No. SI-R12-031 and enacted an organization chart for the Pueblo, listed as \"Exhibit A,\" including various departments with the Executive branch of government. (c) Subsequently, the Pueblo enacted a budget which attached a different organizational chart for the government. (d) It is in the best interests of the Pueblo to clarify and adopt a single organizational chart for the government of the Pueblo. ( July 21, 2016, SI-R16-015 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.3.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3|1.3.3.040", "title": "1.3.3.040 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.050", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.3.050 Governmental Organization (a) Resolution No. SI-R12-031 and the Governmental Organizational Act, enacted on August 20, 2012, are hereby repealed. (b) The Council hereby adopts the attached organizational chart (Exhibit B), which shall serve as the official organizational chart for the government of the Pueblo. (c) The Governor shall not have the power to alter or modify the attached organizational chart (Exhibit B). (d) All prior organizational charts for the government of the Pueblo are hereby repealed. ( July 21, 2016, SI-R16-015 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.3.050", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.3|1.3.3.050", "title": "1.3.3.050 Governmental Organization", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.3.050"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 1.3.4 Typographical Correction Act of 2016 1.3.4.010 Findings 1.3.4.020 Short Title 1.3.4.030 Purpose 1.3.4.040 Findings 1.3.4.050 Corrections Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R16-012, dated July 7, 2016.", "num": "1.3.4", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4", "title": "Part 1.3.4 Typographical Correction Act of 2016", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.4.010 Findings (a) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso (\"Pueblo') is a sovereign and self-governing Tribe, recognized as such by the United States of America; (b) The voters of the Pueblo approved a Governing Agreement (\"Agreement\") for the Pueblo on November 19, 2011, and the Bureau of Indian Affairs approved the Agreement on December 21, 2011, pursuant to Federal law; (c) The Council is authorized to make laws for the Pueblo de San Ildefonso pursuant to Section 5 of the Agreement; (d) The Council finds the need to correct two typographical errors in the Governing Agreement of the Pueblo; (e) The Council hereby enacts the attached law entitled, \"Typographical Correction Act of 2016.\" (f) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Council hereby approves and adopts this resolution in accordance with the requirements of the Agreement, according to published Council procedures, and authorizes and directs the Governor, or his designee, to take such actions as deemed necessary to carry out the intent of this resolution. ( July 7, 2016, SI-R16-012 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.4.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4|1.3.4.010", "title": "1.3.4.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.4.020 Short Title This enactment shall be known as the \"Typographical Correction Act of 2016\" (\"Act\"). ( July 7, 2016, SI-R16-012 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.4.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4|1.3.4.020", "title": "1.3.4.020 Short Title", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.4.030 Purpose The purpose of this Act is to correct two, minor, non-substantive, typographical errors in the Governing Agreement (\"Agreement\") of the Pueblo. ( July 7, 2016, SI-R16-012 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.4.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4|1.3.4.030", "title": "1.3.4.030 Purpose", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.4.040 Findings The Council hereby finds and declares that: (a) In 2011, the voters of the Pueblo approved the Agreement to establish a new form of government for the Pueblo. (b) The Council recognizes that it cannot unilaterally modify the Agreement unless approved by the voters of the Pueblo; however, the Council also recognizes that the Agreement sets the foundation for the government and must be interpreted in a logical and sensible manner especially when the courts are presented with a question regarding the interpretation of the Agreement. (c) The Agreement includes two, minor, non-substantive, typographical errors involving the juxtaposition of two letters in the traditional name for the Pueblo as listed in the Preamble of the Agreement, and the single word \"of\" incorrectly listed for the word \"or,\" which represents a typographical error of one letter. (d) The only logical reading of ELECTIONS AND VOTING, Section 4. Removal , of the Agreement leads to the conclusion that the word \"of\" is incorrectly listed for the word \"or\" so that the proper meaning of ELECTIONS AND VOTING, Section 4. Removal, can only be discerned by using the word \"or.\" ( July 7, 2016, SI-R16-012 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.4.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4|1.3.4.040", "title": "1.3.4.040 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.050", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 1.3.4.050 Corrections (a) The Courts, when interpreting and applying the Agreement, shall give the only logical and reasonable interpretation to the Preamble, and to ELECTIONS AND VOTING, Section 4. Removal , in accordance with the typographical errors corrected by this Act. (b) The Preamble of the Agreement shall use word \"Po-woh-geh\" in place of the word \"Po-who-geh.\" (c) ELECTIONS AND VOTING, Section 4. Removal , of the Agreement shall use the word \"or\" in place of the word \"of\" so that the first sentence of Section 4 should read as follows: \"The People give the Council power to remove a fellow Council Member or the Governor by at least a four-fifths vote of the entire Council, excluding the Member or Members of the Council subject to removal, after providing due process, including a written list of charges, adequate notice to provide a defense, and an opportunity to provide a defense.\" (d) The Governor shall ensure that all official copies of the Agreement prepared or issued by the Pueblo shall include the two typographical corrections contained in this Section 1.4 of this Act. ( July 7, 2016, SI-R16-012 ; August 20, 2012, SI-R12-031 .)", "num": "1.3.4.050", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|1|1.3|1.3.4|1.3.4.050", "title": "1.3.4.050 Corrections", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/1.3.4.050"}
