{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 2.1.1.020 The Pueblo government affects accountability every day in the day-to-day operations of the Pueblo and its departments, authorities, and programs; ( April 18, 2012, SI-R12-018 .)", "num": "2.1.1.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|2|2.1|2.1.1|2.1.1.020", "title": "2.1.1.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 2.1.1.030 Various signatures of Pueblo officials and employees are required on a daily basis in order to process paperwork and implement various programs; ( April 18, 2012, SI-R12-018 .)", "num": "2.1.1.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|2|2.1|2.1.1|2.1.1.030", "title": "2.1.1.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 2.1.1.040 The Pueblo does not explain the reasons for including each signature, which undermines accountability of each Department, Authority, and Program to the People; ( April 18, 2012, SI-R12-018 .)", "num": "2.1.1.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|2|2.1|2.1.1|2.1.1.040", "title": "2.1.1.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.050", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 2.1.1.050 Each signature may affect accountability to the Pueblo People and legal liabilities of the Pueblo or the signing official or employee. ( April 18, 2012, SI-R12-018 .)", "num": "2.1.1.050", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|2|2.1|2.1.1|2.1.1.050", "title": "2.1.1.050", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/2.1.1.050"}
