{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.3.1 Annual Budget Authorization for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 6.3.1.010 Findings 6.3.1.020 6.3.1.030 6.3.1.040 6.3.1.050 Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R15-014, dated June 22, 2015.", "num": "6.3.1", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1", "title": "Part 6.3.1 Annual Budget Authorization for Fiscal Year 2015-2016", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.1.010 Findings (a) Section 5(a)(ii)(A) of the Agreement requires the Pueblo to enact an Annual Budget which includes all projected revenues and expenditures; (b) For budget purposes, revenues are defined as increases in financial resources received during the year to meet financial obligations incurred during the year; (c) The Governor's Office and Tribal Council have developed and proposed an Annual Budget to continue operating the Tribe's departments and programs for the next fiscal year; (d) The Pueblo's Annual Budget consists of four (4) fund types within the financial system: the General Fund that is the basic operating fund that accounts for everything not accounted for in another governmental fund; the Special Revenue Fund that is specific revenue fund sources that are limited to being used for a particular purpose; the Capital Projects Fund for fund accounts for the construction, rehabilitation, and acquisition of capital assets, such as land, buildings, equipment, and roads; and the Business Fund for funds on activities financed primarily by revenues generated by activities themselves; (e) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is divided into three (4) categories with the following amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,162,541 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213 (f) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso's total FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget Council is $10,620,566. ( June 22, 2015, SI-R15-014 .)", "num": "6.3.1.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1|6.3.1.010", "title": "6.3.1.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.1.020 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 consists of the following budgets and amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,162,541 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213 ( June 22, 2015, SI-R15-014 .)", "num": "6.3.1.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1|6.3.1.020", "title": "6.3.1.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.1.030 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Council hereby approves and enacts the attached Annual Budget in the total amount of $10,749,566 effective July 1, 2015 to June 30, 2016. [NEED ATTACHMENT] ( June 22, 2015, SI-R15-014 .)", "num": "6.3.1.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1|6.3.1.030", "title": "6.3.1.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.1.040 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso shall not expend any General Fund Capital Project funds without prior approval from the Tribal Council. ( June 22, 2015, SI-R15-014 .)", "num": "6.3.1.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1|6.3.1.040", "title": "6.3.1.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.050", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.1.050 The Tribal Administration is directed to provide the Council no less than quarterly with a financial report that shows budget variances in revenues and expenditures. ( June 22, 2015, SI-R15-014 .)", "num": "6.3.1.050", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.1|6.3.1.050", "title": "6.3.1.050", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.1.050"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.3.2 FY 2015-2016 New Funding Council Adjustment \"NF-1\" 6.3.2.010 Findings 6.3.2.020 6.3.2.030 6.3.2.040 Editor's Notes NEED RESOLUTION # FOR NF-1", "num": "6.3.2", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.2", "title": "Part 6.3.2 FY 2015-2016 New Funding Council Adjustment \"NF-1\"", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.2.010 Findings (a) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is divided into four (4) categories with the following amounts: GENERAL FUND (GF) $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND (SRF) $4,162,541 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND (CPF) $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND (PF) $702,213 (b) The Pueblo's total FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget approved by the Council is $10,620,566; (c) Section 5(a)(ii)(A) requires that \"Budget modifications by the Council shall be permitted no more than twice a year; provided, that budget modifications by the Council to obtain new grants, appropriate matching funds for new grants, or to expend new grant funds may be done at anytime\"; (d) The Council established a Budget Modification Process and categorization for all funds, approved funds, newly acquired grants, new matching funds, and/or new funds, to systematically track the different types of budget modifications; (e) The Pueblo has acquired new grants and new funds and thus requires a budget adjustment; (f) The Pueblo enacted a law entitled, \"Budget Modification Process Act\" which establishes establishes the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" designation for all new grants, new matching funds, and or new funds acquired by the Pueblo. The budget adjustment for the new funding will be identified as \"NF-1\", \"NF-2\", and so on; (g) The Pueblo has established the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" designation for all new grants, new matching funds, and or new funds acquired by the Pueblo. The budget adjustment for the new funding will have attached a budget, scope of work and identified as \"NF-1\", \"NF-2\", and so on; (h) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 New funding is identified per the following: (1) SRF: USDA \u2013 Pajarito Waste Water $130,000 (2) SRF: BIA \u2013 Child Passenger Safety Seat $5,000 (3) SRF: BOR \u2013 Irrigation Planning $150,269 (4) SRF: BIA (OTJS) \u2013 Tribal Code $50,000 Total Special Revenue Fund $335,269 (i) The Pueblo's total FY 2015-2016 Special Revenue Fund would increase from $4,162541 to $4,497,810 as a result of the new funds; (j) The modified Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget will be modified to reflect the following amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,497,810 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213 (k) The Pueblo's total FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget will be $10,955,835.", "num": "6.3.2.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.2|6.3.2.010", "title": "6.3.2.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.2.020 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Tribal Council hereby approves the \"New Funding Council Adjustment NF-1\" and modifies the Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 which consists of the following budgets and amounts: (a) USDA \u2013 Pajarito Waste Water $130,000 (b) BIA \u2013 Child Passenger Safety Seat $5,000 (c) BOR \u2013 Irrigation Planning $150,269 (d) BIA (OTJS) \u2013 Tribal Code $50,000 Total Special Revenue Fund $335,269", "num": "6.3.2.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.2|6.3.2.020", "title": "6.3.2.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.2.030 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Tribal Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 as modified consists of the following budgets and amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,497,810 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213", "num": "6.3.2.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.2|6.3.2.030", "title": "6.3.2.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.2.040 The Council hereby approves the identified adjustments and enacts the Annual Budget in the total amount of $10,955,835 effective upon the passage of this resolution.", "num": "6.3.2.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.2|6.3.2.040", "title": "6.3.2.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.2.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.3.3 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-2\" 6.3.3.010 Findings 6.3.3.020 6.3.3.030 6.3.3.040 Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R16-001, dated February 5, 2016.", "num": "6.3.3", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.3", "title": "Part 6.3.3 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-2\"", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.3.010 Findings (a) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso's (\"Pueblo\") FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is divided into four (4) categories with the following amounts: GENERAL FUND (GF) $2,505,812 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND (SRF) $4,497,810 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND (CPF) $3,250,000 PROPRIETARY FUND (PF) $702,213 (b) the Pueblo's total FY 2015-2016 Annual \"Adjusted\" Budget is $10,955,835; (c) Section 5(a)(ii)(A) requires that \"Budget modifications by the Council shall be permitted no more than twice a year; provided, that budget modifications by the Council to obtain new grants, appropriate matching funds for new grants, or to expend new grant funds may be done at anytime\"; (d) The Council established a Budget Modification Process and categorization for all funds, approved funds, newly acquired grants, new matching funds, and/or new funds, to systematically track the different types of budget modifications; (e) The Pueblo has acquired new grants and new funds and thus requires a budget adjustment; (f) The Pueblo enacted a law entitled, \"Budget Modification Process Act\" which establishes the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" designation for all new grants, new matching funds, and or new funds acquired by the Pueblo. The budget adjustment for the new funding will be identified as \"NF-1\", \"NF-2\", and so on; (g) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 New Funding NF-2 is identified per the following: (a) SRF: I.H.S \u2013 Septic System $25,000.00 (b) SRF: BIA \u2013 Transportation: Shu Maa Po Road $158,994.94 (c) SRF: NM State Library Program $5,333.33 (d) SRF: NM State Library Program $7,526.55 (e) SRF: University of NM: Suicide Prevention $20,000.00 (f) GF: Healthy Kids $1,820.00 (g) GF: Youth Program: Winter Summit $12,762.00 Total Adjustment $231,436.82 (h) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 new adjusted FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget would increase from $10,955,835 to $11,187,271.82; (i) The modified Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is divided into the following amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,520,394.00 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,714,664.82 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000.00 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213.00 (j) The Pueblo's total FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget will be $11,187,271.82. ( February 5, 2016, SI-R16-001 .)", "num": "6.3.3.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.3|6.3.3.010", "title": "6.3.3.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.3.020 The Council hereby approves the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" \"NF-2\" and adjusts the Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 which consists of the following budgets and amounts: (a) SRF: I.H.S \u2013 Septic System $25,000.00 (b) SRF: BIA \u2013 Transportation: Shu Maa Po Road $158,994.94 (c) SRF: NM State Library Program $5,333.33 (d) SRF: NM State Library Program $7,526.55 (e) SRF: University of NM: Suicide Prevention $20,000.00 (f) GF: Healthy Kids $1,820.00 (g) GF: Youth Program: Winter Summit $12,762.00 Total Council Adjustment $231,436.82 ( February 5, 2016, SI-R16-001 .)", "num": "6.3.3.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.3|6.3.3.020", "title": "6.3.3.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.3.030 The Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 is adjusted with the following budgets and amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,520,394.00 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,714,664.82 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000.00 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213.00 ( February 5, 2016, SI-R16-001 .)", "num": "6.3.3.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.3|6.3.3.030", "title": "6.3.3.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.3.040 The Council hereby approves the identified adjustments and enacts the Annual Budget in the total amount of $11,187,271.82 effective upon enactment. ( February 5, 2016, SI-R16-001 .)", "num": "6.3.3.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.3|6.3.3.040", "title": "6.3.3.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.3.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.3.4 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-3\" 6.3.4.010 Findings 6.3.4.020 6.3.4.030 6.3.4.040 Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R16-006, dated May 16, 2016.", "num": "6.3.4", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.4", "title": "Part 6.3.4 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-3\"", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.4.010 Findings (a) Currently the Pueblo's total FY2015-2016 total Annual Budget is $11,028,390.38, which consists of the following categories and amounts: GENERAL FUND $2,520,394.00 SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $4,555,783.38 CAPITAL PROJECTS FUND $3,250,000.00 PROPRIETARY FUND $702,213.00 (b) Section 5(a)(ii)(A) of the Agreement also allows budget modifications by the Council no more than twice a year, provided that budget modifications by the Council to obtain new grants, appropriate matching funds for new grants, or to expend new grant funds may be done at any time; (c) The Pueblo enacted a law entitled, \"Budget Modification Process Act\" which establishes the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" designation for all new grants, new matching funds, or new funds acquired by the Pueblo. The budget adjustment for the new funding will be identified as \"NF-1,\" NF-2,\" and so on; (d) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 New Funding 3 (NF-3) is identified per the following: (a) SRF: BIA/Transportation TAP Sidewalk Project $175,489 (b) SRF: DOH Healthy Kids $60,000 Total New Funding 3: $235,489 (e) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 new adjusted FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget will increase from $11,028,390.38 to $11,263,879.38; (f) The Pueblo's modified FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is as follows: General Fund (GF) $2,520,394.00 Special Revenue Fund (SRF) $4,791,272.38 Capital Projects Fund (CPF) $3,250,000.00 Proprietary Fund (PF) $702,213.00 TOTAL BUDGET: $11,263,879.38 ( May 16, 2016, SI-R16-006 .)", "num": "6.3.4.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.4|6.3.4.010", "title": "6.3.4.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.4.020 The Council hereby approves the \"New Funding Council Adjustment 3 (NF-3)\" and adjusts the Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 by addition of the following: (a) SRF: BIA/Transportation TAP Sidewalk Project $175,489 (b) SRF: DOH Healthy Kids $60,000 Total New Funding 3: $235,489 ( May 16, 2016, SI-R16-006 .)", "num": "6.3.4.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.4|6.3.4.020", "title": "6.3.4.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.4.030 The Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2016-2017 is adjusted with new amounts as follows: General Fund (GF) $2,520,394.00 Special Revenue Fund (SRF) $4,791,272.38 Capital Projects Fund (CPF) $3,250,000.00 Proprietary Fund (PF) $702,213.00 ( May 16, 2016, SI-R16-006 .)", "num": "6.3.4.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.4|6.3.4.030", "title": "6.3.4.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.030"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.040", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.4.040 The Council hereby approves the identified adjustments (NF-3) and enacts the FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget in the new total amount of $11,263,879.38. ( May 16, 2016, SI-R16-006 .)", "num": "6.3.4.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.4|6.3.4.040", "title": "6.3.4.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.4.040"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.3.5 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-4\" 6.3.5.010 Findings 6.3.5.020 6.3.5.030 6.3.5.040 Editor's Notes This law was originally enacted pursuant to Council Resolution No. SI-R16-009, dated May 26, 2016.", "num": "6.3.5", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.5", "title": "Part 6.3.5 FY 2015-2016 New Funding \"NF-4\"", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.5.010 Findings (a) Currently the Pueblo's total FY2015-2016 total Annual Budget is $11,263,879.38, which consists of the following categories and amounts: General Fund (GF) $2,520,394.00 Special Revenue Fund (SRF) $4,791,272.38 Capital Projects Fund (CPF) $3,250,000.00 Proprietary Fund (PF) $702,213.00 (b) Section 5(a)(ii)(A) of the Agreement also allows budget modifications by the Council no more than twice a year, provided that budget modifications by the Council to obtain new grants, appropriate matching funds for new grants, or to expend new grant funds may be done at any time; (c) The Pueblo enacted a law entitled, \"Budget Modification Process Act\" which establishes the \"New Funding Council Adjustment\" designation for all new grants, new matching funds, or new funds acquired by the Pueblo. The budget adjustment for the new funding will be identified as \"NF-1,\" NF-2,\" and so on; (d) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 New Funding 4 (NF-4) is identified per the following: (a) SRF: BIA/CTGP/Aid to Tribal Government/Accounting $16,458 (b) SRF: BIA/CTGP/Aid to Tribal Government/Governor's Office $16,458 Total New Funding 4: $32,916 *See Attachment A (Memorandum) (e) The Pueblo's FY 2015-2016 new adjusted FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget will increase from $11,263,879.38to $11,296,795.38; (f) The Pueblo's modified FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget is as follows: General Fund (GF) $2,520,394.00 Special Revenue Fund (SRF) $4,824,188.38 Capital Projects Fund (CPF) $3,250,000.00 Proprietary Fund (PF) $702,213.00 TOTAL BUDGET: $11,296,795.38 (g) The Council hereby approves and authorizes the \"New Funding Council Adjustment 4\" \"NF-4\" attached hereto and that such adjustments shall be effective immediately upon enactment. ( May 26, 2016, SI-R16-009 .)", "num": "6.3.5.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.5|6.3.5.010", "title": "6.3.5.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.5.020 The Council hereby approves the \"New Funding Council Adjustment 4 (NF-4)\" and adjusts the Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2015-2016 by addition of the following: (a) SRF: BIA/CTGP/Aid to Tribal Government/Accounting $16,458 (b) SRF: BIA/CTGP/Aid to Tribal Government/Governor's Office $16,458 Total New Funding 4: $32,916 *See Attachment A (Memorandum) ( May 26, 2016, SI-R16-009 .)", "num": "6.3.5.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.5|6.3.5.020", "title": "6.3.5.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.5.030 The Annual Budget for Fiscal Year 2016-2017 is adjusted with new amounts as follows: General Fund (GF) $2,520,394.00 Special Revenue Fund (SRF) $4,824,188.38 Capital Projects Fund (CPF) $3,250,000.00 Proprietary Fund (PF) $702,213.00 TOTAL BUDGET: $11,296,795.38 ( May 26, 2016, SI-R16-009 .)", "num": "6.3.5.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.5|6.3.5.030", "title": "6.3.5.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.030"}
