{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.3.5.040 The Council hereby approves the identified adjustments (NF-4) and enacts the FY 2015-2016 Annual Budget in the new total amount of $11,296,795.38. ( May 26, 2016, SI-R16-009 .)", "num": "6.3.5.040", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.3|6.3.5|6.3.5.040", "title": "6.3.5.040", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.3.5.040"}
