{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.5.13.030 The Pueblo request to enter into a new Pub. L. 93-638 contract with the funds. ( September 1, 2017, SI-R17-024 .)", "num": "6.5.13.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.13|6.5.13.030", "title": "6.5.13.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.13.030"}
