{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.5.18 Submittal for the 2017 Congressinal Directive-Allocation of Increased Road Maintenance Funding 6.5.18.010 Findings 6.5.18.020 6.5.18.030 6.5.18.040", "num": "6.5.18", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.18", "title": "Part 6.5.18 Submittal for the 2017 Congressinal Directive-Allocation of Increased Road Maintenance Funding", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.010", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.5.18.010 Findings (a) The Pueblo de San Ildefonso (\"Pueblo') is a sovereign and self-governing Tribe, recognized as such by the United States of America. (b) The Council is authorized to make laws for the Pueblo de San Ildefonso pursuant to Section 5 of the Agreement, the governing document of the Pueblo. (c) Under the authority granted by the 2017 Congressional Directive \u2013 Allocation of Increased Road Maintenance Funding, and in accordance with the requirements of Public Law (Pub. L.) 93-638, as amended; 25 CFR Part \u00a7170.423 (TTP Regulations); the Southwest Regional Office, Department of Transportation (SWRO-DOT) hereby offers the Tribe the first right-of-refusal to contract available funds. (d) To contract the 2017 Congressional Directive one-time funds, the Tribe is required to submit to the SWRO-DOT the following documents: (1) Scope of Work: Addressing maintenance operations for LOS 4 and 5 BIA routes, with emphasis on school bus routes. (2) Budget (3) Tribal Resolution to Enter into a Pub. L. 93-638 contract. (e) The SWRO-DOT encourages the Tribe to submit the Scope of Work, Budget and Tribal Resolution for review and approval. (f) The Pueblo has prepared a Scope of Work, Budget for the following project: (1) One-Time Congressional Road Maintenance Funding ( August 7, 2018, SI-R18-015 .)", "num": "6.5.18.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.18|6.5.18.010", "title": "6.5.18.010 Findings", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.010"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.020", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.5.18.020 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso Council hereby approves the FY2017 One-Time Congressional Road Maintenance Funds, Statement of Work and Budget (attached). ( August 7, 2018, SI-R18-015 .)", "num": "6.5.18.020", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.18|6.5.18.020", "title": "6.5.18.020", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.020"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.030", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.5.18.030 The Pueblo requests to enter into a new Pub. L. 93-638 contract with the funds. ( August 7, 2018, SI-R18-015 .)", "num": "6.5.18.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.18|6.5.18.030", "title": "6.5.18.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.18.030"}
