{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 6.5.21.030 The Pueblo de San Ildefonso wishes to enter into a Public Law 93-638 contract for these funds. ( January 30, 2019, SI-R19-002 .)", "num": "6.5.21.030", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.5|6.5.21|6.5.21.030", "title": "6.5.21.030", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.5.21.030"}
