{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 6.9.1 Tewa Language Department Establishment Act 6.9.1.010 Short Title 6.9.1.020 Purpose 6.9.1.030 Findings 6.9.1.040 General Policy 6.9.1.050 Organization of the Tewa Language Department 6.9.1.060 Tewa Language Department Goals and Objectives 6.9.1.070 Authorization of Initial Funding", "num": "6.9.1", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|6|6.9|6.9.1", "title": "Part 6.9.1 Tewa Language Department Establishment Act", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/6.9.1"}
