{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code Part 12.1.1 Civil Rights Commission 12.1.1.010 Enrollment 12.1.1.020 Civil Rights Protection 12.1.1.030 Appointment of Civil Rights Commission 12.1.1.040 Authority 12.1.1.050 Complaint of Civil Rights Violation 12.1.1.060 Waiver of Immunity 12.1.1.070 Remedies 12.1.1.080 Appeals form Orders of the Tribal Court 12.1.1.090 Additional Penalties", "num": "12.1.1", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|12|12.1|12.1.1", "title": "Part 12.1.1 Civil Rights Commission", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/12.1.1"}
