{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 17.2.12.010 Short Title This enactment shall be known as the Act, \"APPROVING AND AUTHORIZING THE BUSINESS LEASE WITH SAN ILDEFONSO SERVICES, LLC FOR THE WHITE ROCK CONVENIENCE STORE.\" ( May 10, 2018, SI-R18-006 .)", "num": "17.2.12.010", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|17|17.2|17.2.12|17.2.12.010", "title": "17.2.12.010 Short Title", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/17.2.12.010"}
