{"body": "Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code 24.5.1.070 Authorizes the Governor to enter into the contract between HUD, NHPA, and the Pueblo. ( May 7, 2013, SI-R13-008 .)", "num": "24.5.1.070", "path": "library|Pueblo de San Ildefonso Code|24|24.5|24.5.1|24.5.1.070", "title": "24.5.1.070", "url": "/us/nsn/san-ildefonso/council/code/24.5.1.070"}
